; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=910, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "0000" "グラフィック\リファレンス\リファレンス詳細\rrr51\少年犯罪.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Now then, please look at the materials in front of you. 
{PAUSE ""}
Here in Motoki-cho, the crime rate is by far the lowest in the whole country. 
{PAUSE ""}
The number of juvenile crimes committed last year was five in total. 
{PAUSE ""}
All five were minor offenses such as shoplifting and graffiti, and in every case a settlement has been reached with the victims."<PG>
"Furthermore, the juvenile reoffending rate is also extremely low: over the past 10 years the reoffending rate has been 3%, and these too were minor. 
{PAUSE ""}
This is thought to be largely due to the character of the area and to residents working together as one to foster young people."<PG>
"However, this gives rise to two concerns. 
{PAUSE ""}
The first is that, because of the low crime rate, at present very few places are equipped with security cameras or other crime-prevention equipment. 
{PAUSE ""}
The number of security cameras this station has installed in town, too, currently stands at only 12, all on this station's premises. 
{PAUSE ""}
Since a lack of video material could make investigations difficult should a crime occur in the future, rather than resting on the low crime rate, we will submit a request to purchase crime-prevention equipment within this year."<PG>
"The second is that, because of the low number of juvenile crimes, there is a noticeable tendency for young people to go out at night. 
{PAUSE ""}
A major factor in this is parents' low awareness of crime prevention, and it is not uncommon to see young people at convenience stores or in the busy downtown areas at night."<PG>
"For the time being, this station will limit itself to asking young people to refrain from going out at night whenever they are found, and within this year we will take the measure of having the town's school principals urge young people to refrain from going out at night. 
{PAUSE ""}
That concludes my report."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "0000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "0000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Assistant Inspector Ise<STYLE ID="1"> was really fired up giving that report, wasn't he..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Of course, the </STYLE>Assistant Inspector<STYLE ID="1"> is Motoki-cho's number-one devotee of pretty girls.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Seriously!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―You didn't know? It's famous, </STYLE>Assistant Inspector Ise<STYLE ID="1">'s lolicon taste.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aww... and I had my eye on the </STYLE>Assistant Inspector<STYLE ID="1">... Such a shock..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―The </STYLE>Assistant Inspector<STYLE ID="1">, though... good-looking, good at his job, young... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If only his tastes were normal, he'd be perfect...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh, really, hearing the backstory to that juvenile crime presentation, I'm totally disillusioned..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Now, now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The way the </STYLE>Assistant Inspector<STYLE ID="1"> puts his all into deterring juvenile crime like that, that's a good thing, isn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's true, but... Still, if it came to it, wouldn't the </STYLE>Assistant Inspector<STYLE ID="1"> do something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A devotee of pretty girls, huh... Me, I'd rather have someone older..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "伊勢.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "250"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"So you like them older?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"W-why, if it isn't </STYLE>Assistant Inspector Ise<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Thank you for your hard work, sir, sir!</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------